// Labeled hybrid score counts pairs that name the preferred catalog line.
// No pair returns nothing. Zero is a real count.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE marked ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG marked rank

IMPULSE marked 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "marked" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
